OL,3,AFrench police fire tear gas at school
OL,4,Aprotesters as officer charged over
OL,5,Astudent hit by projectile
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 250,000 people have
OL,8,Fdemonstrated across France in protest
OL,9,Fat what they say is under-investment in
OL,10,Fhigh schools
OL,12,FThe estimate from France's interior
OL,13,Fministry comes as one union says 2,000
OL,14,Fhigh schools shut across the country
OL,16,FAn officer has been charged after a boy
OL,17,Fwas hit by a projectile during protests
OL,18,Fnear Paris last week, as political
OL,19,Fdebate rages over police force
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
