OL,3,AFrench police fire tear gas at school
OL,4,Aprotesters as officer charged over
OL,5,Astudent hit by projectile
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday police fired tear gas in protests
OL,8,Facross the country, including in the
OL,9,Fcapital and Marseille - our reporter
OL,10,Fthere says he can "feel it in my throat
OL,11,Fand eyes"
OL,13,FIn Lyon, a barricade was set on fire;
OL,14,Fwhile in Rennes, police used water
OL,15,Fcannon. In Paris, one 17-year-old tells
OL,16,Fus she studies in "overcrowded" classes
OL,17,Fof 35
OL,19,FIn parliament, French Prime Minister
OL,20,FSebastian Lecornu says: "Burning down a
OL,21,Fhigh school does not improve the state
OL,22,Fof high school buildings"
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
